# Normalise line endings everywhere.
#
# ARCHITECTURE.md binds emitted files to \n regardless of host platform, and the
# determinism rule requires byte-identical output for identical input. Without this,
# Git's autocrlf rewrites checked-in files on Windows checkouts, and golden-file
# comparisons fail on one platform while passing on another.
* text eol=lf

# Explicitly binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
